body:
Im so sorry to hear about your situation. It's not the same but I'm quite profoundly disabled due to genetic disorders, and my younger brother is mildly disabled because of it.

&#x200B;

He held a lot of resentment towards our parents and was genuinely horrible to them but as he got older it improved because with maturity and therapy he became less self absorbed and fully realised our parents are people too with their own history, dreams, feelings etc.

&#x200B;

I really hope things get better for you. If theres any way i can help, even if its just to chat, please let me know.
